  "modifications": "All twelve fine PLY surfaces retain all original vertices, indices, winding and mutual distances. One shared translation/rotation and unit conversion. Illustrative colours and selected transparency. Only temporal bone context is simplified; no fabricated ear structures or contralateral mirror.",
